{
    "word": "appreciator",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "22263ab9-6d1f-32b8-bc96-2c525f60aab1",
                "word": "appreciator",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "70144567-9b21-4951-9330-9ccfe2cef627",
                        "entry_id": "22263ab9-6d1f-32b8-bc96-2c525f60aab1",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "appreciators"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "78d16012-37e5-39e8-87c9-f0de29314dea",
                        "entry_id": "22263ab9-6d1f-32b8-bc96-2c525f60aab1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone who appreciates a given thing, especially:",
                            "Someone who values something highly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a3ba9b0-be01-484e-9a64-2690ea158438",
                                "sense_id": "78d16012-37e5-39e8-87c9-f0de29314dea",
                                "text": "I find, too, that the chance for appreciation [of imaginative literature] is much increased by being the son of an appreciator, and that these boys who now grow up are caught not only years too late, but two or three births too late, to make the best scholars of."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a03ead71-f7b4-4b12-98f4-2110d88245bf",
                                "sense_id": "78d16012-37e5-39e8-87c9-f0de29314dea",
                                "text": "[…] I speak as an appreciator of not just the architecture but the way you have preserved its atmosphere,"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3d2d06a3-2c37-36bc-acc9-7c7b01fad02f",
                        "entry_id": "22263ab9-6d1f-32b8-bc96-2c525f60aab1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Someone who appreciates a given thing, especially:",
                            "Someone who assesses or appraises the value of something."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a518f3a9-e25b-4923-affc-00c392dbbf76",
                                "sense_id": "3d2d06a3-2c37-36bc-acc9-7c7b01fad02f",
                                "text": "I like to keep myself well within the field of the microscope, and, with as much detachment as I can muster, to watch myself live, to report my observations of what I say, feel, think. In default of others, I am myself my own spectator and self-appreciator―critical, discerning, vigilant, fond!—my own stupid Boswell, shrewd if silly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa54a733-5e3a-4d10-856f-cb6eec308dd9",
                                "sense_id": "3d2d06a3-2c37-36bc-acc9-7c7b01fad02f",
                                "text": "Let no chicaning intermediate agent but suffered to pass between the manufacturers and the Company’s warehouse-keepers and sorters, except the sworn appreciators and examiners, according to standard samples, secreted from the view, and from every possible communication with the owners."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b44b10e1-21a7-4dea-9e95-7fb084e7f2f7",
                                "sense_id": "3d2d06a3-2c37-36bc-acc9-7c7b01fad02f",
                                "text": "1794, Review of The Age of Infidelity, in The English Review, Volume 24, p. 124,\nthat respectable collector and appreciator of religious evidence, Archdeacon Paley"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28d957be-e6a4-4291-a914-f97ad9a62244",
                                "sense_id": "3d2d06a3-2c37-36bc-acc9-7c7b01fad02f",
                                "text": "Always, as I wrote, I was both reader and writer, both the conceiver of the action and the appreciator of it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "90c2e739-2fce-4415-936a-c426e82c1977",
                        "source_entry_id": "22263ab9-6d1f-32b8-bc96-2c525f60aab1",
                        "source_sense_description": "one who fully appreciates or understands a given thing",
                        "target_lang_word": "appréciateur",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "appréciateur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87adcf07-caaa-37b1-a945-752374a2f02d",
                                        "entry_id": "9fea0331-4502-33f9-8721-27b014df07b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui apprécie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd498470-830a-4ea6-beb3-f463569714f3",
                                                "sense_id": "87adcf07-caaa-37b1-a945-752374a2f02d",
                                                "text": "Heureux qui possède cette philosophie Appréciatrice de toutes choses !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "appréciateur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e9ba1cc-fc29-358e-b1d9-723dd13e7951",
                                        "entry_id": "d8edd0e9-833f-3e97-a7a4-399fe585d2a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui qui apprécie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9a7d65c-8610-47f9-9db7-cd7e235f828a",
                                                "sense_id": "1e9ba1cc-fc29-358e-b1d9-723dd13e7951",
                                                "text": "Juste appréciateur du mérite."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70d60fde-19b4-3896-95f8-7d0b51653960",
                                        "entry_id": "d8edd0e9-833f-3e97-a7a4-399fe585d2a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui qui fait les estimations, donne le prix des choses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13a5ef4b-5a36-4fbc-b869-2eb755b1aeb8",
                                                "sense_id": "70d60fde-19b4-3896-95f8-7d0b51653960",
                                                "text": "Si vous voulez jouer franc jeu avec moi, je vous indiquerai un appréciateur, un bien honnête homme, qui saura la valeur des tableaux à deux sous près…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a2a51df-4e74-4333-b993-45eb589f0a58",
                                                "sense_id": "70d60fde-19b4-3896-95f8-7d0b51653960",
                                                "text": "Oh ! L’humanité ne règne pas là ; voyez, ils ont déposé au moins pour 120 fr. de valeur ; l’appréciateur les porte à 60 fr. ; écoutez, ils se plaignent ; mais le décret impérial rendant l’appréciateur responsable du montant de l’évaluation, il est clair que cette évaluation n’atteindra jamais la valeur réelle !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c458f98-3251-4da5-a36c-dc59e3cff83d",
                                                "sense_id": "70d60fde-19b4-3896-95f8-7d0b51653960",
                                                "text": "Le gouverneur en conseil nomme, parmi les juges de la Cour fédérale, un appréciateur ainsi que les appréciateurs adjoints qu’il estime nécessaires pour entendre et juger les appels des décisions du ministre en vertu de l’article 32."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
